WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.125 --> 00:00:02.002
Edward, I'm going to
take care of you.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:05.005
♪♪

00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:17.643
What's it like being&nbsp;famous?

00:00:17.643 --> 00:00:18.977
I'm not famous.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:19.645
Yeah, okay.

00:00:21.939 --> 00:00:23.232
This is grief counseling.

00:00:24.316 --> 00:00:26.610
Anyone's invited to speak.

00:00:26.777 --> 00:00:28.779
People meet me and they think,

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:32.241
she's the woman whose nephew

00:00:32.241 --> 00:00:33.909
survived the plane crash.

00:00:35.327 --> 00:00:36.787
But they forget I'm also...

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:39.289
the woman who
lost my big sister.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.585
♪♪

00:00:43.585 --> 00:00:44.878
What are you doing?

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:47.714
Drinking champagne by myself
out of a juice glass.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.174
♪♪

00:00:49.174 --> 00:00:51.885
I lost my husband,
I lost my best friend.

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.388
But he had another life.

00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:57.015
So I don't know how to
piece it all together.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:01:00.060
♪♪

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.561
After I got to 200,
I lost count.

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:03.647
♪♪

00:01:03.647 --> 00:01:05.399
Why is everyone
writing to him?

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:09.236
Cause he survived.

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:13.615
♪♪

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:14.783
I know you want to run away.

00:01:14.783 --> 00:01:16.201
I want to run away too,

00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:17.786
but life has to go on.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:19.997
♪♪

00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:21.123
I don't know who I am.

00:01:21.123 --> 00:01:22.040
Join the club.

00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:27.296
♪♪

00:01:30.966 --> 00:01:32.259
I'm sure you've heard
great things.

00:01:32.259 --> 00:01:33.885
Oh no, no secrets
in grief group.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:36.972
♪♪

00:01:36.972 --> 00:01:38.515
My grandmother paved the way

00:01:38.515 --> 00:01:40.309
and there is no one
more committed

00:01:40.309 --> 00:01:42.436
to carrying on her
legacy than I am.

00:01:44.021 --> 00:01:49.526
♪♪

00:01:50.736 --> 00:01:52.696
What happened
isn't fair, Edward.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:55.741
But I'm going to do my
best to take care of you.

00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:01.121
And that is the truth,

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:03.540
that will never go away.

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:06.960
♪♪

